WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,500
Do you think he is our son?

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:04,940
Give birth to the child secretly

3
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:09,550
When the parents find out, the baby will be spoiled.

4
00:00:09,550 --> 00:00:10,550
Fish, fish, catch daddy

5
00:00:10,550 --> 00:00:11,550
Going to die

6
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:32,810
Still want to chase me

7
00:00:32,810 --> 00:00:34,840
It doesn’t matter how old you are

8
00:00:34,840 --> 00:00:36,840
My mother is probably waiting at the front door.
